[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025724\">7010M10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025704\">7010C44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025720\">7010E11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025603\">5570T96</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025703\">7010C11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025717\">7010D33</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025714\">7010D18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025712\">7010D14</a></p><p>1. Extract the retaining pin.</p><p>2. Remove the lowering window fastening element.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005172.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Use a new fastening element.</p><p>Fit the fastening element and insert the\nretaining pin. The retaining pin should be fully fitted so that\nit is flush with the surface of the fixing element.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025712\">7010D14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025714\">7010D18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025717\">7010D33</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025703\">7010C11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025603\">5570T96</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025720\">7010E11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025704\">7010C44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025724\">7010M10</a></p>"]]